# Explicit remote Wi-Fi policies, loaded before hardware startup.
# No active rows means no Wi-Fi configuration writes.
# serial: 16 hexadecimal digits in vendor-first wire order, or *.
# config: absolute path without whitespace; same format as fttrctl wifi.
# Each file selects one actual ff69/ff6a instance. Multiple instances per
# ONU are allowed; exact serial overrides * for that instance only.
# Repeated serial/instance pairs fail before hardware changes.
# Store credential files with mode 0600; restart to load a changed policy.
# Numeric values are original wire codes, not OpenWrt/hostapd enums.
#
# serial            config
